 tudes and illusions we must break in order to gain full Enlightenment. Joi
 n in for our regular daytime weekly class of Dharma teaching and meditatio
 n. In person at the LBC and live on Zoom. There is also a crèche for thos
 e aged 6 months to 5 years old.
